# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PocketLLM Lite — Web Edition · environment template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env if you need it:   cp .env.example .env
#
# The app is local-first: chats, documents, memories and settings
# live in the browser's IndexedDB. NO environment variable is
# required to run `dev`, `build`, or deploy to Vercel.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Optional — Prisma/SQLite scaffold (prisma/schema.prisma).
# Only needed if you activate src/lib/db.ts for future server
# features. On Vercel this file is ephemeral per lambda, which
# the app tolerates because real user data is client-side.
DATABASE_URL=file:./db/custom.db
